pristar-p15-driver (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * CUPS filter (CUPS raster -> L11 bitmap commands) and backend (BLE GATT
    with credit-based flow control).
  * p15-leconnect helper (cap_net_raw) to force the LE bearer.
  * PPD with 22x12 .. 50x15 mm label sizes, density and paper-type options.

